-        *   Update the distance to the next boundary for the selected axis:
-            $$ \text{sideDist}_{new} = \text{sideDist}_{old} + \text{mask} \times \text{deltaDist} $$
-        *   Record the hit voxel $\mathbf{V}_{new}$ [S3, unofficial].
